  "GDS actions and auth live proof": "GDS 操作和身份验证实时证明",
  "GDS governs labels, descriptions, validation, and submit-state behavior.": "GDS 管理标签、描述、验证和提交状态行为。",
  "GDS is designed to be used by AI coding agents and any LLM-powered coding tool. Every component ships TypeScript contracts, a machine-readable entry point (llms.txt), and drop-in repo rules so agents build with the real system automatically.": "GDS 旨在供 AI 编码代理和任何 LLM 支持的编码工具使用。每个组件都附带 TypeScript 合约、机器可读的入口点 (llms.txt) 和嵌入式存储库规则，以便代理自动使用真实系统进行构建。",
  "GDS notification retry timed out.": "GDS 通知重试超时。",
  "GDS now exposes a governed 12-type chart contract with shared state and fallback behavior.": "GDS 现在公开了一个受管理的 12 种图表合约，具有共享状态和后备行为。",
  "GDS pattern catalog": "GDS 图案目录",
  "gds-compliance check": "GDS 合规性检查",
  "GdsAccessGate / resolveGdsAccessState": "GdsAccessGate / 解析GdsAccessState",
  "GdsBadge takes a tone when it reports system state, and resolves its own colour pair against the surface it sits on.": "GdsBadge 在报告系统状态时会发出声音，并根据其所在的表面解析其自己的颜色对。",
  "GdsGeneratedHero shares GdsGeneratedThumbnail's palette and seed engine at banner scale: an accent wash plus one of four pluggable background strategies, and up to 6 ranked badges at a fixed size ladder (one large, two medium, three small) — fixed slots, not free placement, so the composition never reads as clutter.": "GdsGenerateHero 在横幅规模上共享 GdsGenerateThumbnail 的调色板和种子引擎：重音清洗加上四种可插入背景策略之一，以及固定大小梯子上最多 6 个排名徽章（一个大，两个中，三个小） - 固定插槽，而不是自由放置，因此构图永远不会显得混乱。",
  "GdsGeneratedThumbnail (epic 503) composes a deterministic, zero-network SVG+HTML thumbnail from a listing's own category data — no image hosting, no AI image generation. paletteSource=\"theme\" (default, left two cards) reads the active theme's brand colors, so switching themes above restyles these along with everything else. paletteSource=\"category\" opts into the fixed curated-accent system instead, for consumers who want category color to stay stable across theme changes. The last card is badges=\"none\": motif only, which is what a card renders when a listing has no photo — a badge there would repeat the title the card already prints beneath it.": "GdsGenerateThumbnail (epic 503) 根据列表自己的类别数据组成确定性的零网络 SVG+HTML 缩略图 - 无图像托管，无 AI 图像生成。 PaletteSource=\"theme\"（默认，左侧两张卡）读取活动主题的品牌颜色，因此切换上面的主题会重新设置这些主题以及其他所有内容的样式。对于那些希望类别颜色在主题变化时保持稳定的消费者来说，paletteSource =“category”选择使用固定的策划强调系统。最后一张卡片是badges=“none”：仅主题，这是当列表没有照片时卡片呈现的内容 - 那里的徽章会重复卡片已经打印在其下方的标题。",
  "GdsGeneratedThumbnail / GdsGeneratedHero / GdsGeneratedAvatar / GdsGeneratedMark": "GdsGenerateThumbnail / GdsGenerateHero / GdsGenerateAvatar / GdsGenerateMark",
  "GdsMap, GdsMapBasemapWash, GdsMapFilterRail, GdsMapPinPreviewCard": "GdsMap、GdsMapBasemapWash、GdsMapFilterRail、GdsMapPinPreviewCard",
  "GdsMapPinBadge follows the same ambient mode — the ring stays the category's accent, the pin fills with a fixed dark-neutral disc in emoji mode (never the accent), and the emoji centers on it.": "GdsMapPinBadge 遵循相同的环境模式 - 环保持类别的重音，图钉在表情符号模式下填充固定的深色中性圆盘（绝不是重音），并且表情符号以其为中心。",
