  "Governed responsive kanban board: portrait mobile stacks columns vertically, landscape/tablet/desktop render multi-column with horizontal scroll. Cards always offer a keyboard-accessible move menu, plus an opt-in pointer/touch/keyboard drag handle (enableDrag) built on accessible sensors rather than native drag-and-drop. Columns support server-pagination counts (totalCount), a per-column footer for load-more/pagination (renderColumnFooter), and controlled collapse/expand (collapsible + collapsedColumnIds).": "受控的响应式看板：纵向移动设备垂直堆叠列，横向/平板电脑/桌面渲染具有水平滚动的多列。卡始终提供可通过键盘访问的移动菜单，以及基于可访问传感器而不是本机拖放构建的选择加入指针/触摸/键盘拖动手柄 (enableDrag)。列支持服务器分页计数 (totalCount)、用于加载更多/分页的每列页脚 (renderColumnFooter) 以及受控折叠/展开 (collapsible + CollapsedColumnIds)。",
