  "If you already consume GDS package exports instead of direct Mantine or Tabler imports, this should be a low-risk update.": "如果您已经使用 GDS 包导出而不是直接 Mantine 或 Tabler 导入，那么这应该是一个低风险更新。",
  "If your mail client does not open, copy the address and send the same fields manually.": "如果您的邮件客户端未打开，请复制地址并手动发送相同的字段。",
  "If your request is aligned with the next-wave adoption surface, it gets a clear path to production sooner.": "如果您的请求与下一波采用面一致，它就会更快地获得清晰的生产路径。",
  "image accepts any node on ListingCard, PublicProductCard, and PublicFoodCard — GdsGeneratedThumbnail composes directly into that slot, no changes to the card components required, so a listing keeps an on-brand thumbnail instead of a blank gray icon the moment it exists, real photo or not.": "图像接受 ListingCard、PublicProductCard 和 PublicFoodCard 上的任何节点 - GdsGenerateThumbnail 直接组合到该插槽中，无需更改卡片组件，因此列表在存在时保留品牌缩略图，而不是空白的灰色图标，无论是否是真实照片。",
  "Image primitive with a branded fallback and reserved aspect-ratio box so a failed image never collapses a card or shifts layout.": "具有品牌后备和保留纵横比框的图像基元，因此失败的图像永远不会折叠卡片或改变布局。",
