  "On small screens the system prioritizes next actions, urgent exceptions, recent work, then analytics.": "在小屏幕上，系统会优先考虑下一步行动、紧急例外情况、最近的工作，然后是分析。",
  "One detail contract for page and drawer modes.": "一份关于页面和抽屉模式的详细合同。",
  "One field:": "一个字段：",
  "One GdsProvider at the app root — never nest a second one": "应用程序根目录下有一个 GdsProvider — 切勿嵌套第二个",
  "One governed toggle in two geometries: the corner form composes onto a map pin, the button form sits in a preview card's action row. Both are the same labelled button with aria-pressed — never a decorative heart — and both take their size from the control scale, so a compact theme moves them with everything else. The accessible name states the action available; aria-pressed carries the state, so neither is announced twice.": "两种几何形状中的一个受控切换：角形式组成到地图图钉上，按钮形式位于预览卡的操作行中。两者都是相同的带有咏叹调的标签按钮，而不是装饰性的心形，并且两者的尺寸都来自控制比例，因此紧凑的主题使它们与其他一切一起移动。可访问的名称表明了可用的操作； aria-pressed 承载着状态，因此两者都不会被声明两次。",
  "One install command and a single GdsProvider at the app root. Agents follow these same two steps before composing any component.": "应用程序根目录下有一个安装命令和一个 GdsProvider。代理在组成任何组件之前遵循这两个相同的步骤。",
  "One install command, one required provider. Agents follow these same steps.": "一个安装命令，一个必需的提供程序。代理遵循相同的步骤。",
