  "One shared drawer contract for filters.": "一份用于过滤器的共享抽屉合同。",
  "one step down the same accent’s own ladder at weight 2.25; selection scales the whole marker by": "一个人以 2.25 的重量沿着相同口音自己的阶梯走下去；选择将整个标记缩放",
  "One useGdsBrowseSelection instance drives both halves of a browse split view: select a card or its pin and the other follows.": "一个 useGdsBrowseSelection 实例同时驱动浏览分屏视图的两侧:选择卡片或其图钉,另一侧会自动跟随。",
  "One value in every preset, in both schemes.": "在两种方案中，每个预设都有一个值。",
  "One-off product screens, business logic, private integrations, or sensitive requests are not tracked on the GDS board.": "GDS 板上不会跟踪一次性产品屏幕、业务逻辑、私有集成或敏感请求。",
  "oneOf/anyOf schemas require an explicit GDS renderer override.": "oneOf/anyOf 模式需要显式 GDS 渲染器覆盖。",
