  "Only reusable GDS capability requests belong in this repository and project board. Product-specific work must stay with the owning product.": "只有可重复使用的 GDS 功能请求才属于此存储库和项目板。产品特定的工作必须与所属产品保持一致。",
  "Only reusable, accessible, non-product-specific needs become GDS issues. This is the contract for what gets promoted, routed, or rejected.": "只有可重复使用、可访问、非产品特定的需求才会成为 GDS 问题。这是关于晋升、路由或拒绝的内容的契约。",
