  "Real OpenStreetMap tiles via GdsMap, composed under GdsMapBasemapWash — the tiles desaturate and take a tint of the active theme's canvas colour, so the basemap reads as part of the page rather than a foreign surface. The filter rail's counts come from the same markers the map renders, and selecting a pin opens its preview card. Tiles, markers and the ODbL credit are all governed, and switching the theme above re-initialises the map because Leaflet holds imperative DOM the CSS cascade cannot reach.": "通过 GdsMap 的真正 OpenStreetMap 图块，在 GdsMapBasemapWash 下组成 - 图块会降低饱和度并呈现活动主题的画布颜色的色调，因此底图读取为页面的一部分而不是外部表面。过滤器导轨的计数来自地图渲染的相同标记，选择一个图钉会打开其预览卡。平铺、标记和 ODbL 信用都受到控制，并且切换上面的主题会重新初始化地图，因为 Leaflet 拥有 CSS 级联无法到达的命令 DOM。",
