  "Semantic actions and canonical auth/share surfaces exist so products do not need local wrappers for buttons, login providers, or social distribution.": "语义操作和规范的身份验证/共享界面的存在，因此产品不需要按钮、登录提供程序或社交分发的本地包装。",
