  "Tap a badge — onSelect + tintWithBackground": "点击徽章 — onSelect + titorWithBackground",
  "Team members": "团队成员",
  "Teams need a high-quality public surface without inventing local shells, cards, hero sections, navigation, or CTA rhythm.": "团队需要高质量的公共界面，而无需发明本地 shell、卡片、英雄部分、导航或 CTA 节奏。",
  "Telemetry contract": "遥测合同",
  "Template cookbook": "模板食谱",
