  "Urgent errors should stay visible above broad analytics.": "紧急错误应该在广泛的分析之上保持可见。",
  "Usage": "用法",
  "Use a canonical period control before inventing date-range chrome.": "在发明日期范围镶边之前，请使用规范的周期控件。",
  "Use accent panel for advisory messaging.": "使用强调面板进行咨询消息传递。",
  "Use ActionBar, SemanticButton, provider identity actions, and ShareButtonGroup as the governed interaction path.": "使用 ActionBar、SemanticButton、提供程序身份操作和 ShareButtonGroup 作为受控交互路径。",
  "Use ArticleShell for docs, legal, and editorial readability.": "使用 ArticleShell 提高文档、法律和编辑的可读性。",
  "Use case": "使用案例",
  "Use Cases": "使用案例",
  "Use DiscoveryShell directly for new sidebar-first apps when possible.": "如果可能，直接将 DiscoveryShell 用于新的侧边栏优先应用程序。",
  "Use docs primitives whenever a route explains installation, API contracts, governance, or adoption decisions.": "每当路线解释安装、API 合约、治理或采用决策时，请使用文档原语。",
  "Use docs routes for policy and usage guidance, then validate behavior against live proofs where interaction/runtimes are relevant.": "使用文档路由作为策略和使用指南，然后根据交互/运行时相关的实时证据验证行为。",
  "Use FormSection for grouped admin form content.": "使用 FormSection 来分组管理表单内容。",
  "Use GDS confirmation and toast contracts instead of browser dialogs.": "使用 GDS 确认和 Toast 合约而不是浏览器对话框。",
  "Use GDS public primitives when the surface explains, markets, converts, or routes users before authentication.": "当表面在身份验证之前解释、营销、转换或路由用户时，使用 GDS 公共原语。",
  "Use GDS with AI": "将 GDS 与 AI 结合使用",
  "Use live proof routes to verify runtime behavior, not just static documentation copy.": "使用实时证明路由来验证运行时行为，而不仅仅是静态文档副本。",
  "Use one configurable listing-card contract instead of proliferating event, venue, and community cards.": "使用一份可配置的列表卡合同，而不是大量的活动、场地和社区卡。",
  "Use one reusable composition, not local detail shells.": "使用一种可重复使用的组合，而不是局部细节外壳。",
  "Use one structure for feature messaging.": "使用一种结构进行功能消息传递。",
  "Use only where the full PublicProductCard contract is not needed.": "仅在不需要完整的 PublicProductCard 合同的情况下使用。",
  "Use placeholder when governance requires visible placeholder state.": "当治理需要可见的占位符状态时使用占位符。",
  "Use PlaybackSurface for bounded rich media experiences with explicit metadata and stable action affordances.": "使用 PlaybackSurface 获得具有显式元数据和稳定动作可供性的有限富媒体体验。",
  "Use public-flow and playback contracts for step-based public experiences and keep hardware preview exceptions explicit.": "使用公共流和播放合约来实现基于步骤的公共体验，并保持硬件预览例外的明确性。",
  "Use semantic actions instead of free-form button stacks wherever the intent is already known.": "在意图已知的情况下，使用语义操作而不是自由格式的按钮堆栈。",
  "Use shared form fields for all labels and errors.": "对所有标签和错误使用共享表单字段。",
  "Use shared sections and form contracts.": "使用共享部分并形成合同。",
  "Use shared select semantics for branch choices.": "使用共享选择语义进行分支选择。",
  "Use shipped contracts first": "首先使用已发货的合同",
  "Use shipped shell contracts instead of local AppShell wrappers.": "使用附带的 shell 合约而不是本地 AppShell 包装器。",
  "Use the admin package when operators create, edit, review, moderate, or delete durable resources.": "当操作员创建、编辑、审查、审核或删除持久资源时，请使用管理包。",
  "Use the API reference to pick imports before creating local wrappers.": "在创建本地包装器之前，使用 API 参考来选择导入。",
  "Use the canonical package and provider setup before adopting patterns locally.": "在本地采用模式之前，请使用规范包和提供程序设置。",
  "Use the canonical share-button group instead of per-product icon clusters.": "使用规范的共享按钮组而不是每个产品的图标簇。",
  "Use the media-field contract for upload, URL entry, preview, status, and recovery.": "使用媒体字段合同进行上传、URL 输入、预览、状态和恢复。",
  "Use the public discovery and listing contracts before creating custom cards.": "在创建自定义卡之前，请使用公开发现和列表合同。",
  "Use the same detail contract across page and drawer modes instead of growing product-local profile panels.": "跨页面和抽屉模式使用相同的详细合同，而不是增加产品本地配置文件面板。",
  "Use the same pattern for every editor.": "对每个编辑器使用相同的模式。",
